  "describe": "Phone: 'Aura One' and $349 at the top, dark (Midnight) headphones on a pale turntable disc, a card below with 'Colour Midnight', four swatches (the first ringed) and an Explode view button. Exploded: the band lifts, cups move out, cushions in, yokes up; five labelled leader lines (Headband, Foam cushion, 40 mm driver, Aluminium yoke, Ear cup) on the nearer cup, and the button says Assemble. A swatch tap recolours shell and cushions. Tablet: model left, a side panel with title, price, colour, swatches, button, four specs and a sentence.",
